title: caveLoad
---
<<declare $meterValue = 0>>
<<declare $stage=0>>
<<declare $hasTrophy=false>>
===

title: checkScore
---
// This checks if the player accumulated 8 or more points
<<if $meterValue >= 6>>
    <<jump successDialogue>>
<<else>>
    <<jump failDialogue>>
<<endif>>
===

title: YStart
---
<<set $stage = 0>>
<<show_image normal>>
Murmurs of yetis: Woahh they got a human...Who is this guy…. I paid for this guy?…
Heckler 1: If you're not going to make a joke, get off the stage, Buddy!!
Heckler 2: I paid COLD hard cash for this!
Heckler 3: This is why humans shouldn't be comedians. 
    -> I'm here to slay all you wretched beasts!
        <<set $meterValue += 1>>
        <<set $stage = 0>>
        <<set_crowd_img>>
        Heckler 3: I'd like to see you try, Tiny!
            -> This sword has penetrated the FROZEN hearts of many!
                Heckler 3: Are you gonna tell a joke or what?
                <<jump Joke1>>
    -> What's a yeti's biggest fear? Me!
        <<set $meterValue += 2>>
        <<set $stage = 1>>
        <<set_crowd_img>>
        Heckler 1: Who do this guy thinks they are? We ain't scared of you! HAHA!
            -> You should be scared of the amount you drank tonight…
                Heckler 3: Are you gonna tell a joke or what?
                <<jump Joke1>>
    -> Um….What do you call uh… um…
        <<set $stage = 2>>
        <<set_crowd_img>>
        Heckler 2: …
        Heckler 3: Are you gonna tell a joke or what?
        <<jump Joke1>>
===



title: Joke1
---
-> What steps should you take if you see a dangerous Yeti?
    -> Very large ones!
        <<set $meterValue += 3>>
        Heckler 2: HAHA! Humans are just so weak and little.
            -> We aren't that tiny…
                Heckler 3:  Yeah, ants think you're giants at least!!
                <<jump Joke2>>
            -> Compared to you guys…
                Heckler 3: Compared to us, you look like a snack-sized appetizer. Don't make me step on you.
                <<jump Joke2>>
-> How do Yetis tell the time?
    -> With a sasq-watch.
        <<set $meterValue += 1>>
        Heckler 3: I'm so sick of them comparing us to Big Foot.
        Heckler 4: My feet are a very normal size, thank you very much!
            -> You're right it was a stretch…
                <<jump Joke2>>
-> I'm going to kill you. Then I'm going to take your heads back to the other humans.
    Heckler 2: Okay, Pipsqueak.
        -> aw, man...
            <<jump Joke2>>
===


title: Joke2
---
-> What do you call a yeti with a six pack?
    Heckler 1: ME!
        -> It's not your turn YETi, bucko.
            <<set $meterValue += 1>>
            Heckler 1: You're just jealous... Fight me, and I'll show you!
                -> Uhh... is there security in here?
                    <<jump Joke3>>
        -> Have you looked at your reflection in the ice lately...?
            <<set $meterValue += 2>>
            Heckler 1: Hey! It's just under all the fur...
                -> Yeah... right...
                    <<jump Joke3>>
        -> Someone's had snow much to drink...
            <<set $meterValue += 1>>
            Heckler 2: Get this guy out of here! I wanna hear the show!
            Heckler 1: alRigHT! ImMa GoiNG!
                -> Can I get what he's having?
                    <<jump Joke3>>
-> So... airplane food...
    Heckler 3: What's an airplane?
        <<jump Joke3>>
===


title: Joke3
---
-> Snowbody parties like a yeti! AM I RIGHT?!
    <<set $meterValue += 2>>
    <<jump Joke4>>
-> You in the white, what's your name?
    Heckler 2: Bongo.
        -> What do you do for work, Bongo?
            Bongo: I'm a yeti...?
                -> What does that entail?
                    <<set $meterValue += 1>>
                    Bongo: Eating people... terrorizing villagers...The usual?
                    <<jump Joke4>>
                -> Snow many taxes... Am I right?
                    <<set $meterValue += 1>>
                    Bongo: Is that a flavor of human?
                        -> no...
                            Bongo: Not interested.
                            <<jump Joke4>>
        -> Bongo, huh? Big fan of music?
            Bongo: Not really...
            <<jump Joke4>>
===

title: Joke4
---
-> I’m going to be real for a second. Ya’ll have been real loud and its disturbing the villagers. Could we all just call it a fun night and go home?
    <<set $meterValue += 2>>
    Heckler 3: MAN THIS GUY'S HILARIOUS!
        -> Oh... no I'm being serious...
            <<set $meterValue -= 2>>
            Heckler 3: ...
            <<jump checkScore>>
        -> Haha yeah thank you!
            <<jump checkScore>>
-> Why don't Yetis get married? Because they always get cold feet!
    <<set $meterValue += 1>>
    Heckler 3: Stereotypes aren't funny, they're just offensive.
    Bongo: Who do you think you are?
        -> I'm so sorry...
            <<jump checkScore>>
-> I tried to convince my friend I saw a snow monster today... Yeti still didn't believe me!
    <<set $meterValue += 3>>
    Heckler 4: HAHHAHAHHAHA!
    Heckler 3: It's funny because humans are just so dumb!
        -> Oh um.. that's not-
            Heckler 3: HAHHAHAHAHAHAHA
            Heckler 4: Stupid humans, haha!
            <<jump checkScore>>
===


title: failDialogue
---
-> How do Yetis communicate?
    -> With fronty signals!
        Heckler 4: Are you making fun of the way we sound...?
        Heckler 3: English isn't our first language.
            -> What language do you speak?
                -> Icelandic?
                    Heckler 4: Oh...
-> What's a Yeti's favorite type of music?
    -> Snow and roll!
        Heckler 4: A friend of mine was snowed and rolled once...
        Heckler 3: He was just a giant snowball... and then he was gone.
-> What's a yeti's favorite game?
    -> Freeze tag!
        Heckler 3: We lost hundreds to freeze tag.
            -> How do you die in freeze tag?
                Heckler 3: They froze... never to be tagged back in.

Crickets: chirp, chirp, chirp.
Heckler 4: That was really offensive...
Heckler 2: How dare you say such a thing?!
Heckler 3: Get out of here!!
    -> You're just a bunch of snowflakes!
     <<change_scene Exterior>>
===


title: successDialogue
---
Heckler 4 & 3: HAHAHAHAHahahaHAHAhaHAhaahAHAAHAAA!
Announcer: We have our winner, folks, of our 4th Annual Ice Box Comedy Competition!
Announcer: Here's. Your. TROPHY!!!!
<<set $hasTrophy = true>>
<<change_scene Exterior>>
===
